ֶה ,רַב (incl. μείζων), רֹב (μέγιστος) ;] \ngreat; \n__1. of external form, bodily size, measure, extent: λίθος, Mat.2:60; δράκων, Rev.12:3; ἰχθῦς, Jhn.21:11; πόλις, Rev.11:8; μάχαιρα, Rev.6:4, al. \n __2. Of intensity and degree: δύναμις, Act.4:33; φόβος, Mrk.4:41; ἀγάπη, Jhn.15:13; ἄνεμος, ib. 6:18; κραυγή, Act.23:9; φῶς, Mat.4:16; πυρετός, Luk.4:38; θλίψις, Mat.24:21. \n __3. Of rank; \n__(a) of persons: θεός (MM, xvi), Tit.2:13; Ἄρτεμις, Act.19:27; compar. (see infr.), Mat.18:1 (cf. Dalman, Words, 113f.); neut. for masc. (Bl., §32, 1), Mat.12:6; \n __(b) of things: ἁμαρτία, Jhn.19:11; μυστήριον, Eph.5:32; = μεγίστη (see infr., and cf. Field, Notes, 16f.), Mat.22:36; compar. for superl. (M, Pr., 78), 1Co.13:13. \n __4. \n__(a) Compar., μείζων: Mat.11:11 23:17, al.; neut. pl., μείζονα, contr. μείζω, Jhn.1:51; double compar., μειζότερος (M, Pr., 236; Bl., §11, 4), III Jo 4; \n __(b) superl, μέγιστος (Deiss., BS, 365), 2Pe.1:4.\n (AS)","source_line":3398}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"maior","count":1}]},"G345":{"id":"G345","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0345","disambiguated_id":"G0345 =","unique_id":"G0345","headword":"ἀνάκειμαι","transliteration":"anakeimai","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to recline","definition_en":"ἀνά-κειμαι \n [in LXX: I Est.4:10, Tob.9:6 א * ;] \n__1. in cl., as pass. of ἀνατίθημ, to be laid up, laid: Mrk.5:40 Rec. \n __2. In late writers (cf. MM, VGT, see word) = κεῖσθαι, κατακεῖσθαι, to recline at table: Mat.26:20; part. ἀνακείμενος, Mat.9:10 22:10-11 26:7, Mrk.6:26 14:18 16:14, Luk.22:27, Jhn.6:11 12:2 13:23, 28.†\n SYN.: ἀνακλίνω, ἀναπίπτω, the latter denoting an act rather than a state and thus in Jhn.13:25 differing from ἀνάκειμαι (see. Jhn.13:23) by indicating a change of position. (AS)","source_line":449}],"occurrence_count":14,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"mesa","count":6},{"gloss":"sentados","count":2},{"gloss":"convidados","count":1},{"gloss":"reclinados","count":1},{"gloss":"reclinado-à-mesa","count":1},{"gloss":"sentaram-mesa","count":1},{"gloss":"senta-mesa","count":1},{"gloss":"sentados-mesa","count":1}]},"G3979":{"id":"G3979","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3979","disambiguated_id":"G3979 =","unique_id":"G3979","headword":"πεζῇ","transliteration":"pezē","lexical_morphology":"G:ADV","gloss_en":"on foot","definition_en":"πεζός, -ή, -όν\n (πούς), [in LXX for רַגְלִי ;] \n__1. on foot: Mat.14:13 (WH, mg., R, txt.). \n __2. Opp. to going by sea, by land: Mat.14:13 (WH, mg., R, mg.). \n __3. As adv., πεζῇ (sc. ὁδῷ), on foot or by land: Mt 1413 (WH, txt.), Mrk.6:33.†\n (AS)","source_line":4098}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"pé","count":2}]},"G4387":{"id":"G4387","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G4387","disambiguated_id":"G4387 =","unique_id":"G4387","headword":"πρότερος","transliteration":"proteros","lexical_morphology":"G:A","gloss_en":"before","definition_en":"A. Compar., πρότερος, -α, -ον, \n [in LXX for רִאשׁוֹן ,לִפָנִים, etc. ;] \nbefore, of time, place, rank, etc.; in NT always of Time, before, former: Eph.4:22. Adverbially, πρότερον, before, aforetime, formerly: Jhn.7:50, 2Co.1:15, Heb.4:6; opposite to ἔπειτα, Heb.7:27; τὸ π., Jhn.6:62 9:8, Gal.4:13, 1Ti.1:13; αἱ π. ἡμέραι, Heb.10:32; αἱ π. ἐπιθυμίαι, 1Pe.1:14.† \n (AS)","source_line":4517}],"occurrence_count":11,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"antes","count":3},{"gloss":"primeiro","count":2},{"gloss":"primeiramente","count":2},{"gloss":"noite","count":1},{"gloss":"primeira","count":1},{"gloss":"passado","count":1},{"gloss":"anteriores","count":1}]},"G5057":{"id":"G5057","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G5057","disambiguated_id":"G5057 =","unique_id":"G5057","headword":"τελώνης","transliteration":"telōnēs","lexical_morphology":"G:N-M","gloss_en":"tax collector","definition_en":"τελώνης, -ου, ὁ\n (τέλος, ὠνέομαι) \n__1. a farmer of taxes (Let. publicanus). \n __2. A subordinate of the former, who collected taxes or tolls in a particular district, a tax-gatherer (EV, publican): Mat.5:46 10:3, Luk.3:12 5:27, 29 7:29 18:10-11, 13; pl., τ. κ. ἁμαρτωλοί, Mat.9:10-11 11:19, Mrk.2:15-16, Luk.5:30 7:34 15:1; τ. κ. πόρναι, Mat.21:31-32; ὁ ἐθνικὸς κ. ὁ τ., Mat.18:17 (cf. DB, iv, 172; ext., 394 f.; MM, xxiv).†\n (AS)","source_line":5209}],"occurrence_count":21,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"cobradores-de-impostos","count":6},{"gloss":"impostos","count":5},{"gloss":"cobradores-impostos","count":4},{"gloss":"cobrador-de-impostos","count":3},{"gloss":"coletor-de-impostos","count":1},{"gloss":"publicanos","count":1},{"gloss":"cobrador-impostos","count":1}]},"G5461":{"id":"G5461","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G5461","disambiguated_id":"G5461 =","unique_id":"G5461","headword":"φωτίζω","transliteration":"phōtizō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to illuminate","definition_en":"φωτίζω\n (φῶς) [in LXX for אוֹר hi, יָרָה hi., etc. ;] \n__1. intrans., to shine, give light (Arist., Plut., a1.): before ἐπί, Rev.22:5. \n __2. Trans. \n __(a) to illumine, enlighten (Diod., Plut., al.): with accusative, Luk.11:36, Rev.21:23; pass., Rev.18:1. Metaphorical, of spiritual enlightenment (Psa.119:130, Sir.45:17, al.): Jhn.1:9, Eph.1:18 3:9, R, txt., Heb.6:4 10:32; \n __(b) to bring to light, make known (Polyb.): 1Co.4:5, Eph.3:9, R, mg., 2Ti.1:10 (cf. Kennedy, Sources, 107 f.).†\n (AS)","source_line":5627}],"occurrence_count":11,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"ilumina","count":4},{"gloss":"iluminados","count":3},{"gloss":"trará-luz","count":1},{"gloss":"esclarecer","count":1},{"gloss":"trouxe-para-a-luz","count":1},{"gloss":"iluminada","count":1}]},"G560":{"id":"G560","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0560","disambiguated_id":"G0560 =","unique_id":"G0560","headword":"ἀπελπίζω","transliteration":"apelpizō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to despair","definition_en":"ἀπ-ελπίζω \n [in LXX: Isa.29:19 (אֶבְיוֹן), Jdth.9:11, Est.4:17, Sir.22:21 27:21, 